WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.960
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.410
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:48.390
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:58.300
Okayasu...

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:04.300
Momo-chan...

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:17.050
"'A Summer Seduction"'

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:27.700
You opened the door so fast,
you startled me, Adachi-san!

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:31.760
I'm sorry...

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.370
Oh, no! Don't cry about it!

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:38.370
It's okay, this stuff is due
to be thrown away anyway!

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:39.700
lt's no good...

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:43.710
lt's not going to work...

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:48.050
I'm sorry for all the trouble I caused.
I fell crashingly asleep.

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:50.950
No problem! Just take care
on the way home.

00:02:55.390 --> 00:03:00.330
Adachi-san? You're not looking
very well. Are you feeling okay?

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.330
Not very.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.820
Um... suddenly it's stuffy in here...

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:38.030
I'm... I'm sorry, okay?

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:42.040
Don't worry. I wasn't
waiting for you to apologize.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.410
Okayasu, I'm dating you
with the full knowledge

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:47.380
that you love Misao-chan...

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:50.830
It's only natural for you to
want to kiss someone you love.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:56.790
But for you to steal a kiss
while she was sleeping

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.390
isn't like you at all, Okayasu.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:01.320
If she'd been awake,
she'd probably have slapped you silly!

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:15.690
What can l do? l'm his second, after all.
l've got no right to complain.

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:21.810
Maybe we should've
broken up that time...

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:25.350
I'm home!

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.680
Welcome home. Your friend is here.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:28.680
Friend?

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.050
Hey!

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.020
What are you doing here?!

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:38.690
I thought it might be fun
if we had some girl talk, Momo-chan!

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:40.790
I'm sorry, but...

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.360
"'Kairi"'

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:55.710
That's probably from Okayasu!
Why don't you answer it?

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:57.380
Hello? Kashiwagi, here.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:59.710
Eh? Sae-chan?

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:02.320
Okayasu! You're such a jerk!

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.950
I heard all about it from Momo-chan!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:05.350
What are you planning
on doing about this?

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.660
What happened between you and Okayasu?

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.690
If you don't tell me,
I'll get the story from Okayasu!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.340
Momo-chan, Okayasu's got another lover?!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:28.340
Well? Which of you does he like better?

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:31.350
That's the one thing I won't say.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:34.680
Oh, come on! You've told me
everything so far!

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:36.350
All right. I get it, Momo-chan.

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:39.690
You're just having a little fun with me
to start a rumor, right?

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:40.690
Who knows?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:44.360
You wouldn't do that!
After all, summer vacation is here.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.020
I wouldn't do it, even if
it weren't summer vacation!

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:52.700
But it doesn't really matter.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:56.370
If we break up, there'll still be rumors.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.370
You're going to break up with Okayasu?

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:01.080
Well, I mean, this is impossible.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:04.270
No matter how much
I love Okayasu, he's...

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:13.660
If I'd been shown that scene before,
the old me would've smacked him!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:17.660
But now I can't do it. I can't even
say what I want to say to him.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.330
I don't want him to hate me, you see.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:23.330
It feels like I'm not the same me.
I'm repressing my real nature...

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:28.000
I just thought that I love him so much
I just want to be with him... And yet...

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:30.230
This hurts so much...

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:37.040
But if you love him, what can you do?

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:43.690
Someone that you can love with all
your heart doesn't come along every day.

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:45.950
And the chances of finding
someone you love

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.360
who will love you back are even scarcer.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:52.360
Okayasu hasn't started seeing
this other girl yet, has he?

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:58.370
Then the fight isn't over yet!
But if you give up, it is over.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:03.390
Well, that's what I've come
to think about Ryo-sama.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:10.540
I never thought I'd hear you
give me a pep talk.

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:19.450
How strange that Sae's words
have cheered me up.

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:23.330
Welcome!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.330
What a lovely smile!

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:27.660
Thank you, sir!

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:29.660
Shall I warm up your lunch?

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:30.670
Yes, please.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.000
Yes, sir!

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:35.070
She's right. lt's no good
being down in the dumps!

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:37.340
l've gotta not give up
until the bitter end!

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:40.170
And the fight's not over yet!

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.020
Sae-chan...

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:56.320
Come on, tell me the truth!
How do you feel about Momo-chan?

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:58.690
Listen...

00:07:58.690 --> 00:07:59.690
What?

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:02.630
Did Momo-chan really
confide in you, Sae-chan?

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:05.630
Well, yeah! But I had
to nudge her a little...

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:06.740
Is that right?

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:11.310
I've pushed her into such despair
that she'd even talk to you, Sae-chan...

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:13.770
Hey! What's that supposed to mean?!

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:17.980
Up to now I've been the one
Momo-chan confided in.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:23.320
I'm so bad. I've really
hurt Momo-chan a lot.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:27.320
By the way, how does this other
girl of yours feel about you?

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:29.890
There's nothing for her to feel.

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:32.660
I don't think she has the
slightest idea about my feelings.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:34.660
Well, there you go!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:38.000
That's why your situation
isn't going anywhere!

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.000
Because you haven't told
the other girl how you feel!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:45.300
And that's why you can't
get serious about Momo-chan!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.350
You're right...

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:53.680
I can't believe I'm being
rebuked by Sae-chan...

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:58.810
Can't be helped! You're such
a jerk, even l can tell you!

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:05.920
Oh, this is fun! I think
I'll drop in on her more often!

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:12.630
Okayasu, you're just afraid to
get deeply involved with someone!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:15.300
You're afraid of being
rejected and getting hurt!

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.970
That's why you can't
declare your love to Misao-chan!

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:23.500
Then no one will ever love you!
Is that really what you want?

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:31.990
Sae was here?

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:34.320
Mm-hmm. She gave me
quite a lecture, and then left.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:37.330
She came here just for that?

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:38.660
Probably.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.330
What's going on?

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.900
You see, Sae-chan has changed too much.

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:45.000
When she suddenly starts
giving good advice,

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.340
after all that I know about her,
it makes me suspicious.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:50.670
Yes! That's right! I thought so, too!

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.200
Right?

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:06.040
Sure enough, it makes me so happy just
to be walking home with you, Okayasu.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:12.030
It's possible that, without even knowing it,
I was becoming possessive of you...

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:15.460
Thinking that you were
mine alone, Okayasu.

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:24.040
Okayasu, if there's something
wrong with me, tell me, and I'll fix it!

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.910
What are you talking about?

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:27.710
What could be wrong
with you, Momo-chan?

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:29.470
If I wait...

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:36.510
If I hang in there and wait,
maybe someday you'll love me...

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.350
Thanks for walking me home.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.750
Well, good night.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:26.300
lf l hang in there and wait,
maybe someday you'll love me...

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:43.950
"'Aki"'

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.580
Kairi?

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.390
What are you doing here so late?

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.060
What's on your face?!

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:57.070
What do you mean? It's a facial pack.
But what is it you want?

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.460
Uh...

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:01.500
Well...

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:08.010
How're you feeling?

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:11.010
Oh, I'm just fine! I took some iron pills.

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:15.420
Oh, that's good. In that case... See ya.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:25.760
Wait, Kairi!

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:29.360
How can you come outside
looking like that?

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:32.660
Well, you must've come for some reason.

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:40.170
Hold it a minute while I take this off...

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.380
Misao-chan...

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:48.680
That part of you which isn't bothered
by anything is what I love about you.

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:53.220
You like taking care of people,
and you're kind.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:55.710
Just being with you makes me feel warm.

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:01.650
You see... I love you, Misao-chan.

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:14.680
Oh, you! You're making fun of me!

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.010
I am not making fun of you!

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:19.350
Then what are you talking about?
You're going with Adachi-san, right?

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:22.350
Yeah, but all this time...

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:25.380
It's been you I've loved, Misao-chan!

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:36.700
Please say something.

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:39.170
I'm sorry. I was just stunned.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:45.040
Kairi, never in a million years
would I have thought you felt that way.

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:50.040
Yeah... All this time,
I've been hiding my feelings.

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:55.050
But Momo-chan told me that if I
keep that up, no one will ever love me.

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:59.720
That's when I realized that if I didn't
say anything, nothing would ever happen.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:03.050
So I decided that if I ever wanted you
to love me, I had to tell you...

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:08.930
Would you be able to see me
as your lover?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:19.010
I'm sorry... I... I can only think of you
as being like a little brother to me, Kairi.

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:21.030
I'll always feel that way.

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:30.080
Thank you. I feel much better.

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:45.370
Yeah?

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:47.030
Sorry. Were you asleep?

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.700
Okayasu?

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:52.100
A little while ago, I declared
my love to Misao-chan.

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:59.380
She turned me down! You know,
it's really not as bad as I thought.

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:03.990
I figured being rejected would
be like the end of the world,

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:07.990
but somehow, we ended up chatting about
different things for about an hour...

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:11.990
So, that's that. The thing with
Misao-chan came to nothing.

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:14.330
Sorry for all the trouble I caused you.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.990
Okayasu...

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:19.190
Are you all right?

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:26.670
Mm-hmm... Well, to be sure, the damage to
my heart is pretty severe, but I'm alive.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:30.470
And the reason why is because
you're there to talk to, Momo-chan.

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:36.680
Knowing that someone loves you
can be a real support.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:40.320
Still, just because
Misao-chan doesn't want me,

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:42.690
doesn't mean I can
just run to you, Momo-chan.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:45.030
Yeah, I understand.

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:48.360
Momo-chan, remember you told me,
before we started dating,

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:51.030
that you had no idea how you felt?

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:51.700
Uh-huh.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.370
Well, that's where I am right now.

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:57.710
I have lots of things I need
to think about by myself,

00:15:57.710 --> 00:16:00.980
so I need to put some distance between
you and me for a while, Momo-chan.

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:04.650
I need to figure out exactly how I feel...

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:07.770
Until then, will you wait for me?

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:17.990
No! You don't have to wait! If you
find someone better than me, go for it!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:21.620
Of course, there's no one in the world
better than me, you know!

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:25.460
Silly!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:31.700
l'll wait forever for you, as long as
there's hope l can have you...

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.700
Waiting and trusting is an easy victory...

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:45.020
What?! Okayasu's not here?!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:48.690
Shoot! I was gonna tease him!

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:51.360
You're a piece of work.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:53.690
So, what happened? Any more
trouble between you?

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:54.700
Not especially.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:58.100
Liar! Did Okayasu declare
his love to the other girl?

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:02.640
Ah-ha! He did! And?
What was the response?

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:05.640
It seems like he was turned down.

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:09.940
What fun! Ah! But in that case,
he's gonna take up with Momo-chan again,

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:12.310
and I can't bear that!

00:17:12.310 --> 00:17:14.320
Listen, you...

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:17.650
Ah! You liar! Okayasu is here!

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:19.320
Sae-chan, you're here again?

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.550
You don't look happy to see me.

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:24.660
Finished talking to the manager?

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:27.960
Yeah. Can I talk to you a second?
The boss said we could go out.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.390
You don't have to come, too!

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:42.680
You and the boss were
talking a long time.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:44.350
He wanted to try to change my mind.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.010
Change your mind?

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:49.020
I'm quitting as of today.

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:50.690
Oh...

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:53.350
What'll you do during summer break?

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:57.690
Well, for the time being, I want
to think about stuff while I'm walking.

00:17:57.690 --> 00:17:59.030
While walking?

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:02.630
Mm-hmm. They say it's easier
to work things out while walking.

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:05.260
So I thought I'd walk
as far as I can, and then see.

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:12.310
And after figuring things out,
will you tell me what you decide?

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:13.640
What's this?

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:18.310
Remember we talked about going to
the seashore, where we first met?

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:20.580
Well, I made reservations
for a one-night two-day trip

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:22.320
on the last day of the summer break.

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:26.650
Okayasu, if you get things worked out
in your head and decide you still want me,

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:28.990
then meet me in the plaza in front
of the station at 12:00 on that day.

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:32.990
I'll wait five minutes,
and if you don't come,

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:34.890
I'll know to forget you, Okayasu.

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:40.130
All right.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.340
Well, I'm off.

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:46.240
Take care!

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:52.350
And l will work on myself. l'll make myself
strong enough to accept...

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:56.280
...whatever Okayasu's decision
may be, and l'll wait...

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:06.630
Well, this is sure boring...

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:09.120
Oh, dear! What will I do?

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:13.530
"'Help Wanted

00:19:27.150 --> 00:19:29.380
"'No New Messages"'

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:29.980
Nothing...

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.990
Once again, l realized...

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:34.560
...that his wanting to put
distance between us

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.320
means that he'll have
no contact with me at all.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:42.030
l guess it's only natural, but still...

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.530
lt's pretty lonely...

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:53.340
No! This will never do!
By the time Okayasu gets back,

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:55.810
I have to make myself
a much tougher person!

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:00.680
Right! The kind who isn't shook up
over every little thing!

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:03.480
The kind who can laugh
and take in any kind of circumstance!

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:04.920
That's the kind of woman!

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:08.420
Welcome!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.030
Why... Why are you here?!

00:20:16.030 --> 00:20:18.030
Why? I've got a job here.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.700
You're kidding! What, starting today?

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:20.370
Uh-huh.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:21.700
Until when?

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:24.710
For now, just until the end of summer.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:25.710
I don't believe it...

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:29.010
A- actually, I work here, too...

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.710
Really? Since when?

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:33.870
Since right after school ended.

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:39.390
What's that Kashiwagi thinking?

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:41.720
Don't tell me Sae asked you to do this...

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:45.390
Yeah, she called me yesterday...

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:49.400
Hello, Toji? You free? Are you
interested in a summer job?

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:56.070
The convenience store by the station is
really short-handed because I quit working.

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:58.540
I've already talked to the manager
about you, so you can start tomorrow!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:20:59.740
Thanks!

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:01.730
Huh?! Hey, wait! Kashiwagi!

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.350
And that's what happened.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:08.680
Sae...

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:22.990
Geez! That Sae!
What the devil is she up to?

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:28.370
School is bad enough! Now to have
the two of us working together...

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:31.370
What'll l talk to him about?

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.070
Adachi... Shall I quit?

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.750
If my working here is
uncomfortable for you, Adachi,

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:41.050
I can find someone else to work here.

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:45.050
N- no! Uncomfortable?! No not at all!

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:46.720
Excuse me...

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:48.060
Yes, Ma'am!

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:49.680
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:21:55.730 --> 00:22:00.330
Yikes! Why am l so ultra-conscious of
every little thing! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:02.500
lf l react like this to every little thing,

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:05.340
l'm just giving Sae
the satisfaction she wants!

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:07.930
Toji and l are a thing of the past!

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:14.440
Right now, the only one
l'm thinking of is Okayasu...

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:42.840
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:52.520
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:55.520
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.520 --> 00:23:02.130
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:08.470
Where can we go

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:18.150
where we can all be

00:23:18.150 --> 00:23:20.810
under the same sky?

00:23:20.810 --> 00:23:29.160
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:35.830
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.830 --> 00:23:42.170
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.170 --> 00:23:49.510
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.510 --> 00:23:57.140
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:04.460
What am l gonna do? l can't
help my feelings for Toji!

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:06.730
Where is Okayasu now?

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:11.130
l said l'd wait for him,
but l'm afraid of being swept away!

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:14.360
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'The Emotional Puzzle"'
